  "id": "creamy-roasted-parsnip-soup",
  "name": "Creamy Roasted Parsnip Soup",
  "subtitle": "Roasted root vegetables blended with warm spices and dairy",
  "description": "Roast parsnips and carrots, then simmer them with aromatics, spices, stock, milk, and cream for a smooth, gently sweet soup.",
